  "body": "Since Synapse v1.9.0 the below exception is thrown ...\r\n`AttributeError: 'ModuleApi' object has no attribute 'hs'`\r\n\r\nfor the following line of code ...\r\n`store = yield self.account_handler.hs.get_profile_handler().store`\r\n\r\n... which is part of a password provider. The result is that it is no longer possible to login through the password provider. \r\n\r\nAny idea of a quick fix? \r\n",
